      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f0a364/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-15T12:41:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just use clear magic sleeves. Let's me enjoy the nice artwork on the back as well as make it easier to identify a deck at a glance.</p>",
